== choice_1
What’s wrong with this cup? After discovering the poison, I replaced it with a clean cup. Could that bastard Song Zhi Nian still have a backup, or is it He Renshu?#Layout:Left 
    ->END
  
== choice_2
...This is the handkerchief Yue Ling gave to Song Zhi Nian as a token of her feelings. I took it from his handkerchief pocket before I acted; he doesn’t deserve it!#Layout:Left 

When Yue Ling asked me, “What if I want to give him a handkerchief and get rejected? I might become the laughingstock of their circle,” I encouraged her to try bravely... I personally led her down this cruel and difficult path... But saying this now is pointless. Yue Ling doesn’t need to worry; even if I die, I will protect her path.#Layout:Left #CE:ED_6
    ->END

== choice_3
This bouquet's arrangement is clearly meant for Yue Ling; after every performance, we receive mountains of flowers. But this one looks too tattered, lacking even a ribbon.#Layout:Left #CE:ED_9
    ->END
    
